{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50112","headline":"游仙窟诗 游後园 · 崔十娘","name":"游仙窟诗 游後园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梅蹊命道士，桃涧伫神仙。\n旧鱼成大劒，新龟类小钱。\n水湄唯见柳，池曲且生莲。\n欲知赏心处，桃花落眼前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔十娘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}